# Wilderland Scrounger: "Ferocious - Whenever this creature attacks while you control a creature with power 4 or greater, put a
# +1/+1 counter on each creature you control." The "while" is part of the trigger event, checked only as the Scrounger attacks and
# not again on resolution (no intervening "if", CR 603.4; the ruling). On turn 3 Bot2 exiles the Alpine Grizzly (power 4) with
# Swords to Plowshares in response to the trigger: it still resolves, and the Scrounger gets its counter.

